---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import KcSection from '../components/KcSection.astro';
import LeadForm from '../components/LeadForm.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';

const jsonLd = {
  '@context': 'https://schema.org',
  '@type': 'Person',
  name: 'KC Daniel',
  jobTitle: 'Auctioneer and Real Estate Broker',
  worksFor: { '@type': 'Organization', name: site.name },
  alumniOf: ['Nova Southeastern University', 'Florida Atlantic University', 'Indian River State College'],
  award: '2010 Florida Auctioneers Association Bid Calling Champion',
  sameAs: [site.stuartMagazineUrl],
};
---
<Layout
  title="About KC Daniel | Associate Auctions"
  description="KC Daniel is a second-generation auctioneer, Florida real estate broker and J.D., and the 2010 Florida Bid Calling Champion. Founder of Associate Auctions in Stuart, FL."
  jsonLd={jsonLd}
>
  <section class="page-head">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="eyebrow">About</div>
      <h1>Associate Auctions &amp; KC Daniel</h1>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>Associate Auctions is a Treasure Coast auction company based in Stuart, Florida. It is dedicated to the values and traditions of auction history while developing new ways to bring buyers and sellers together.</p>
        <p>KC Daniel grew up around auctions. In 2000 he moved his young family to Stuart and joined his father's auction business, Karlin Daniel &amp; Associates, learning the trade from the ground up. Along the way he earned degrees in finance and real estate from Florida Atlantic University and a law degree from Nova Southeastern University, because, as he puts it, “we deal with estate and partnership dissolution, so knowing what the attorneys are talking about is extremely important.”</p>
        <p>After law school he worked as a lawyer for a circuit court judge, then as a public policy advocate, and taught law-related courses at Indian River State College. Winning the Florida Auctioneers Association Bid-Calling Championship in 2010 settled it: he launched Associate Auctions to handle estate liquidations and real estate sales.</p>
        <h2>Why it matters to sellers</h2>
        <p>An auction does more than sell property. For families settling an estate, it often brings relief: a clear date, a fair public price and one less thing to manage. “It’s one of the feel-good parts of my profession,” KC told Stuart Magazine.</p>
        <p>KC has also called benefit auctions for local nonprofits, including the Education Foundation of Martin County’s 25th-anniversary celebration.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <KcSection showLink={false} />
  <LeadForm />
</Layout>
